## Wave 1 — Six Parallel Agents

> [!NOTE]
> All six agents start from the same commit (Wave 0 merged to `main`). They touch **strictly non-overlapping files** so there are zero merge conflicts between them.

### Agent A — LLM / Gemini

**Branch:** `zain/agent-a-llm`

#### [NEW] `backend/app/llm/gemini_provider.py`
- `ChatGoogleGenerativeAI` + `.with_structured_output(PydanticModel)`
- Temperatures: `classify`/`resolve` = 0.2, `draft_notifications` = 0.4
- Retry once on parse failure → safe defaults (`other`/`medium`, template drafts)

#### [NEW] `backend/app/llm/base.py`
Shared `invoke_with_retry(chain, fallback_fn)` helper.

#### [MODIFY] `backend/app/llm/factory.py`
Wire `GeminiLLMProvider` into factory (extends Wave 0 stub).

#### [MODIFY] `backend/app/tools/llm_tools.py`
Wire `resolve_contradiction` → `get_llm_provider().resolve_contradiction(...)` (delegates to `contradiction.resolve_group` for winner selection; LLM enriches rationale only).

**Done when:** `MOCK_LLM=false` + key classifies one incident correctly.

---

### Agent B — Contradiction Algorithm

**Branch:** `zain/agent-b-contradiction`

#### [MODIFY] `backend/app/tools/contradiction.py`
Replace Wave 0 stubs with real implementation:

| Function | Logic |
|----------|-------|
| `haversine_m(a, b)` | Geo distance in metres |
| `detect_contradiction_groups(incidents)` | Cluster same 200 m + 60 min window; flag if type differs OR severity >1 level apart |
| `score_source(incident, now)` | `0.6 × SOURCE_WEIGHT + 0.4 × exp(-ageMinutes/30)` |
| `resolve_group(incidents)` | Pick winner by score; set `confidence`; flag `low_confidence_resolution` if < 0.6 |

Source weights: `csv_json=0.95`, `pdf_report=0.90`, `table_dashboard=0.85`, `realtime_feed=0.80`, `web_article=0.70`

**Done when:** Demo Market Quarter pair (csv_json vs web_article, ~50 m apart) → `water_leak` wins without any hardcoded lat/lon `if` block.

---

### Agent C — Ingest Flow

**Branch:** `zain/agent-c-ingest`

#### [MODIFY] `backend/app/flows/ingest_flow.py`
Break monolithic `run_ingest` into 6 step functions:

| Step | Signature | Notes |
|------|-----------|-------|
| `validate_input` | `(body) -> ApiError \| None` | Min 10 chars; valid `sourceType` |
| `normalize_timestamp` | `(raw) -> tuple[str, str]` | ISO parse or UTC now + warning |
| `normalize_location` | `(store, body) -> tuple[Coords\|None, bool, str\|None, float]` | Confidence < 0.3 → clarification flag |
| `sanitize_description` | `(raw) -> str` | Strip HTML, collapse whitespace, max 2000 |
| `assign_id` | `(store) -> str` | `ids.next_incident_id()` |
| `persist_incident` | `(store, incident) -> tuple[Incident\|None, bool]` | Duplicate check (same desc + coords ≤ 10 min) |

`run_ingest` orchestrates all six in order; appends trace steps; returns `(incident, trace, error, is_duplicate)`.

**Done when:** Happy path unchanged; duplicate returns existing incident + `is_duplicate=True`.

---

### Agent D — Plan Flow

**Branch:** `zain/agent-d-plan`

#### [MODIFY] `backend/app/flows/plan_flow.py`
Break into 10 step functions (import tools by API only, never edit them):

| # | Function | Notes |
|---|----------|-------|
| 1 | `fetch_open_incidents` | Filter by status ≠ resolved |
| 2 | `classify_incidents` | Calls `llm_tools.classify_incident` per incident |
| 3 | `detect_contradictions` | Calls `contradiction.detect_contradiction_groups` |
| 4 | `resolve_contradictions` | Per group → `contradiction.resolve_group` + optional LLM rationale |
| 5 | `route_and_match` | `routing.py` + `resources.py` |
| 6 | `build_chains` | Extracts `_build_action_chain` |
| 7 | `check_constraints` | Budget/time vs `settings` |
| 8 | `draft_all_notifications` | Calls `llm_tools.draft_notifications` |
| 9 | `prioritize` | `urgencyScore × severityMult × sourceCred` |
| 10 | `persist_plan` | Saves to store |

**Quick mode:** `planMode == "quick"` → skip steps 3–4.  
**No Market Quarter `if` block** — generic detection only.

Priority formula:
```
severityMult: critical=4, high=3, medium=2, low=1
sourceCred: csv_json=1.0, pdf_report=0.95, table_dashboard=0.9, realtime_feed=0.85, web_article=0.75
```

**Done when:** `POST /plan` returns `planId`; contradictions detected when demo seeds present; quick mode skips steps 3–4.

---

### Agent E — Simulate Flow

**Branch:** `zain/agent-e-simulate`

#### [MODIFY] `backend/app/flows/simulate_flow.py`
Break into 8 step functions:

| Step | Notes |
|------|-------|
| `load_plan` | `ValueError` if missing (→ Eagle maps to 404) |
| `capture_before_state` | `store.snapshot_city_state()` |
| `execute_action_chains` | Per-step status transitions |
| `inject_failure_and_retry` | `forceApiFailure` path |
| `capture_after_state` | Resolve IN_PROGRESS → RESOLVED |
| `compute_metrics` | Incidents/roads/crews deltas |
| `build_animation_frames` | `fast`=4, `realtime`=12, `instant`=1 frames; interpolate crew homeBase → incident; road open→restricted→closed |
| `persist_simulation` | `store.save_simulation` |

**Done when:** Simulation returns correct `animationFrames` count per speed; smoke still 200 OK.

